<title>USA: Boston voters reject an elected school board.</title>
<headline>Boston voters reject an elected school board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston decided to keep an appointed school board for the Boston City School System.</p>
<p>Voters in Boston answered no to the question of whether to elect a school board.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
